{"id":"steam-1072780","steam":1072780,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"The Gentle Golem","summary":"Play as a little ceramic golem, clean up the world and help restore nature! Grow plants to help you traverse, or just grow pretty ones! Explore the Cloudlands at your own pace. Can you uncover its mysteries?","about":"The Gentle Golem is a relaxing open world exploration game inspired by Zelda and PowerWash Simulator! Clean up the corruption that's encroaching on your home! Grow plants to help you traverse, or just grow pretty ones! Explore the Cloudlands at your own pace. Can you uncover its mysteries?\n\n                     \n\n• \nGrow plants on any surface!\n\n• \nClean away the corruption that affect flora and fauna alike.\n\n                               \n\n• \nGrow plants to help you explore, or just grow pretty ones!\n\n• \nWho is your creator? Where are they?","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1072780/7c850f26cc9c2ce58dcf57f08a13b2a86734a2a0/library_600x900.jpg?t=1769870389","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1072780/022f9982d89bf415fb595027a5c06846bba2c530/header.jpg?t=1769870389","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1072780/a0c9bfc9d03d436c9beb02d989ccb3c6be412da2/library_hero.jpg?t=1769870389","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1072780/022f9982d89bf415fb595027a5c06846bba2c530/header.jpg?t=1769870389","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1072780/136ae83ca05709e4fb8ef56d4385290ff0b4160e/ss_136ae83ca05709e4fb8ef56d4385290ff0b4160e.600x338.jpg?t=1769870389","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1072780/136ae83ca05709e4fb8ef56d4385290ff0b4160e/ss_136ae83ca05709e4fb8ef56d4385290ff0b4160e.jpg?t=1769870389"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap